OL,3,GNEWSAMan convicted after mistaken
OL,4,Aidentity cigarette fine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has received a criminal
OL,7,Fconviction for not paying a fine for
OL,8,Fdropping a cigarette butt, even though
OL,9,Fhe says he has never smoked.
OL,11,FLucas Harbourd, 49, was fined for
OL,12,Flittering in Bristol city centre in
OL,13,FDecember 2024, but said he only found
OL,14,Fout in July when he received a court
OL,15,Fletter which said he owed #458.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
