OL,3,GNEWSAMan convicted after mistaken
OL,4,Aidentity cigarette fine
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe later challenged the fine, with 3GS,
OL,7,Fthe company contracted to hand out
OL,8,Ffines on behalf of Bristol City
OL,9,FCouncil, admitting it was a case of
OL,10,Fmistaken identity. But he said he still
OL,11,Fhas to overturn the conviction which he
OL,12,Fbelieves could impact his career.
OL,14,FThe council and 3GS did not respond to
OL,15,Fthe BBC's request for comment.
